# Rendered output is not source. The two v2 exports are 170 MB, which exceeds
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file hard limit, and the v3/v4 exports are just as
# reproducible. Their SHA256 is recorded in docs/HANDOFF.md §8:
#   agent-cut-v2.mp4 / agent-cut-first-export.mp4
#   FDCA15802A463E3E7D0BF63AFF595E2E76013E8B6D7353891E48D31FB13CB16D
# The double star also covers exports staged under out/oracle/*/ (the v4 probes).
out/*.mp4
out/**/*.mp4

# VideoPad installer binaries and the registration backup: not part of the project
*.exe
reg_backup_registration.reg

# Scratch frame dumps used for the MAE content checks
out/frames/
*.gray

# Run logs (Watch-Autosave / Export-Project scratch output). The round-trip .vpj
# dumps kept as evidence are tracked; only the .log chatter is ignored.
logs/*.log

# Scratch media synthesised with ffmpeg for the "add media" example (see
# docs/HANDOFF.md); it is regenerated on demand, not checked in
out/testmedia/

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
